<section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">AegisAI Features</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Core components that power the self-evolving guardian against rogue AI</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      {% for feature in features %}
      <div class="flex flex-col p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600 hover:border-aegis-500/30 transition-colors">
        <span class="text-aegis-400 font-mono text-sm mb-2">{% if forloop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ forloop.index }}</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl lg:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">{{ feature.title }}</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 flex-1 mb-6">{{ feature.description }}</p>
        <a href="{{ feature.cta_url }}" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full sm:w-auto px-5 py-2.5 border border-aegis-500 text-aegis-400 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-aegis-500/10 transition-colors">
          {{ feature.cta_text }}
        </a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-dark-800/50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Challenges &amp; Mitigations</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">We acknowledge the realities of defending against evolving AI threats</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-2">The Arms Race</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">Rogue AI evolves as our defenses evolve. Adversaries can probe our systems, learn what triggers alerts, and adapt. It's a continuous cycle—no silver bullet.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-aegis-400"><strong>Mitigation:</strong> AegisAI's AI Update Generator produces heuristic variants faster than manual development. Federated learning keeps the global model ahead of localized adversaries. We deploy updates within hours, not weeks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-2">False Positives</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">Aggressive detection risks flagging legitimate AI workloads—autoscaling, batch jobs, or research pipelines. Alert fatigue leads to real threats being ignored.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-aegis-400"><strong>Mitigation:</strong> Behavioral baselines and confidence scoring reduce noise. Isolation Forests and similar ML approaches excel at anomaly detection without over-triggering. Playbooks let you tune sensitivity per environment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

